WEBVTT

00:43.501 --> 00:44.627
When I was in school,

00:44.711 --> 00:46.880
there was this gift shop nearby,
and the owner had a dog.

00:49.382 --> 00:51.384
I think his name was Jjongjjong.

00:54.095 --> 00:55.430
Let's see.

00:55.513 --> 00:58.725
- Excuse me, sir, how much is this?
- Oh, 500 won.

00:58.808 --> 01:00.101
- This one too?
- Mm-hmm.

01:01.186 --> 01:03.938
There's another kind you can fly
instead of that ball there.

01:04.022 --> 01:06.066
Jjongjjong seemed detached.

01:06.816 --> 01:09.277
Oh.

01:10.403 --> 01:11.571
Hi, sir, where are you going?

01:12.864 --> 01:14.741
I'm taking
Jjongjjong for a walk.

01:14.824 --> 01:16.493
It looks to me like
you're the only one walking.

01:17.827 --> 01:20.455
You see, Jjongjjong likes to be cuddled.

01:20.538 --> 01:21.664
See you, bye.

01:25.668 --> 01:27.962
He practically
treated his dog like a king.

01:28.046 --> 01:29.672
WITH UNG

01:29.756 --> 01:31.966
- Hi, nice to see you, Ung.
- Hi, how are you?

01:32.550 --> 01:33.510
Huh?

01:34.677 --> 01:36.721
I didn't know you just had a baby.

01:39.974 --> 01:42.143
It seemed to me
like his life was amazing.

01:42.644 --> 01:45.021
You know what? I don't think
I've ever seen his feet touch the ground.

01:45.105 --> 01:47.273
He runs around like crazy at home, though.

01:47.899 --> 01:49.984
When I grow up,
my dream is to live like Jjongjjong.

01:51.736 --> 01:53.780
Ung, to tell you the truth,

01:54.364 --> 01:56.783
when Jjongjjong was a puppy,
he was actually abandoned.

01:56.866 --> 01:59.035
- So he's afraid of the outdoors.
- Really?

01:59.119 --> 02:01.246
Maybe he was abandoned outside.

02:01.329 --> 02:02.914
That's why he acts like that.

02:04.707 --> 02:07.502
Imagine being abandoned
at your happiest moment…

02:07.585 --> 02:09.254
He must have been so scared.

02:13.800 --> 02:15.218
So the reason… 

02:16.094 --> 02:18.346
why I'm suddenly
talking about this is because…

02:18.429 --> 02:19.722
I'm not going, sir.

02:19.806 --> 02:21.599
But why? I really don't get it.

02:21.683 --> 02:23.893
I'm grateful for this opportunity,

02:24.477 --> 02:27.147
- but it's too far, and it's just too long.
- Stop being ridiculous.

02:27.230 --> 02:29.190
When you went there
to study for six months,

02:29.274 --> 02:31.860
I could clearly see how much
your skills drastically improved.

02:31.943 --> 02:33.570
Back then I only stayed six months.

02:34.154 --> 02:36.698
Living there
for several years is different.

02:36.781 --> 02:39.409
Besides, I don't wanna go there alone.

02:39.492 --> 02:41.286
My goodness.

02:42.036 --> 02:43.830
I'll cancel my recommendation then.

02:48.543 --> 02:49.419
But…

02:51.171 --> 02:52.964
If that's the reason why…

02:53.923 --> 02:56.926
you don't want to go, then you can
bring your friend along with you.

03:05.685 --> 03:06.561
ENGLAND STUDY ABROAD

03:06.644 --> 03:08.688
What else do I need?
My GPA won't be an issue.

03:08.771 --> 03:10.023
English scores? TOEFL?

03:10.106 --> 03:12.192
I can get that. No problem.
I study a lot you know.

03:12.275 --> 03:14.777
What about financial support?
Stipends? You know any scholarship?

03:14.861 --> 03:16.237
What about living expenses, huh?

03:18.698 --> 03:22.785
If I bring this up to Yeon-su right now,
I'm sure she'll just tell me to go alone.

03:22.869 --> 03:24.370
But I can't do that, it's too long.

03:24.454 --> 03:26.372
Listen, do you wanna take Yeon-su?

03:26.456 --> 03:27.540
I'm game. You can take me.

03:27.624 --> 03:28.917
I did some research.

03:29.000 --> 03:31.085
There are a lot of schools
that Yeon-su could easily go to.

03:32.212 --> 03:34.589
She has a high GPA,
which is a really good thing.

03:35.798 --> 03:37.342
I'm thinking that it'd be great

03:37.425 --> 03:39.719
for the two of us
to go abroad and study together.

03:41.387 --> 03:42.931
I really wanted to be your manager.

03:43.556 --> 03:46.309
But I can't stop you
because it's such a good opportunity.

03:47.143 --> 03:49.145
Anyway, you two
are going to live together?

03:50.230 --> 03:53.107
Are you serious?
Of course we'll stay in dorms…

03:55.985 --> 03:56.819
Do you think we can?

03:56.903 --> 03:59.405
If you're both going there,
don't you think you should live together?

03:59.489 --> 04:01.199
You'd be going
to a different country.

04:02.116 --> 04:04.285
You need to rely on each other there.

04:05.453 --> 04:07.622
You look so excited.

04:07.705 --> 04:09.958
Wasn't that what you were thinking
in the first place?

04:10.041 --> 04:14.337
Hey, of course not. This is a decision
I'm considering solely for our future.

04:15.713 --> 04:17.465
And I still have to ask Yeon-su first.

04:30.103 --> 04:31.229
Why are you doing this?

04:36.317 --> 04:37.485
What's your reason?

04:41.781 --> 04:43.283
Why do we have to break up?

04:47.203 --> 04:49.080
Why do we have to break up, Yeon-su?

05:18.860 --> 05:22.071
Oh. I'm sorry. What was I talking about?

05:23.031 --> 05:24.699
Right. Jjongjjong.

05:37.712 --> 05:41.090
I've been thinking
a lot about him recently.

05:41.758 --> 05:44.677
About the way he's decided
to cope with his trauma.

05:44.761 --> 05:48.473
See that? We can really
be friends after all.

05:50.183 --> 05:51.559
I know it seems pathetic…

06:06.532 --> 06:10.161
…but I'm… acting like Jjongjjong now.

06:22.090 --> 06:24.467
Honestly, I'm not sure if I can face it.

06:25.343 --> 06:27.595
I can't handle
something I can't bear again.

06:31.641 --> 06:35.978
That's why… I'm choosing
the same method as Jjongjjong.

06:38.231 --> 06:39.482
Because nothing will happen…

06:40.483 --> 06:42.568
if I just stay here and do nothing.

06:43.403 --> 06:50.410
EPISODE 11: OUR NIGHTS
ARE MORE BEAUTIFUL THAN YOUR DAYS

06:51.953 --> 06:53.246
Did you get home safely?

06:58.167 --> 06:59.252
Of course.

06:59.335 --> 07:01.921
You practically pushed me
inside the front door, remember?

07:02.004 --> 07:03.923
Thanks for staying with me today.

07:04.006 --> 07:06.217
And for putting up with my boring stories.

07:16.310 --> 07:17.812
You can call me anytime.

07:36.205 --> 07:37.748
You stopped by my place today?

07:49.385 --> 07:51.596
WE SPOTTED THE ARTIST GO-OH
SECRETLY MEETING NJ

08:02.482 --> 08:05.234
Aren't we releasing a statement
refuting the article?

08:05.318 --> 08:07.236
We don't need to deal with that rumor.

08:08.571 --> 08:10.364
But that's what we've
always done in the past.

08:10.448 --> 08:13.326
That's right, but back then
you were seeing mostly lousy scumbags.

08:13.409 --> 08:14.410
I don't get it.

08:14.494 --> 08:17.205
When I was actually dating those guys,
you would always rush in

08:17.288 --> 08:19.040
and deny those relationships
with the press.

08:19.123 --> 08:21.125
But now that I'm not dating Ung,
you won't even deny it?

08:21.209 --> 08:23.836
The thing is,
compared to your former dating scandals,

08:23.920 --> 08:26.547
the public's response
to this one isn't so negative.

08:26.631 --> 08:28.716
Also he has
a pretty good reputation too.

08:29.342 --> 08:31.636
CEO KANG YEON-JU

08:31.719 --> 08:35.264
Besides, you said
you felt like you were suffocating.

08:36.807 --> 08:39.101
If you can breathe better
when you're next to him,

08:39.185 --> 08:40.561
then I can turn a blind eye.

08:40.645 --> 08:42.480
You can see him and let off some steam,

08:42.563 --> 08:44.482
just don't let it
interfere with your work.

08:52.114 --> 08:55.117
Are you hoping this will pass over
like it did all the other times?

08:56.285 --> 08:58.704
You better stop treating me
like I'm still a little kid.

08:59.997 --> 09:01.374
You're too young to know how to--

09:01.457 --> 09:03.876
Do you think I see him
just so I can feel better?

09:03.960 --> 09:05.294
Isn't it obvious from the photo?

09:05.378 --> 09:07.547
Can't you tell that
I'm the only one who has feelings?

09:07.630 --> 09:09.799
Seeing him more
would only stress me out.

09:09.882 --> 09:12.969
So stop making stupid plans about us,
and I want you to leave him alone.

09:13.052 --> 09:15.555
He's not like some candy
you can throw at me.

09:15.638 --> 09:16.847
YEON ENTERTAINMENT

09:16.931 --> 09:19.517
Remember this,
he has nothing to do with my actions.

09:23.187 --> 09:25.189
"It would also appear that NJ

09:25.273 --> 09:28.859
would visit this artist at his home
whenever she had any free time."

09:28.943 --> 09:33.155
"The two would frequently
enjoy a meal at their favorite restaurant

09:33.239 --> 09:34.740
before going to her house."

09:36.325 --> 09:37.618
Her house?

09:38.619 --> 09:41.747
Funny, right, Ung?
They're claiming you went to her house.

09:42.331 --> 09:45.751
You and NJ, her house, it doesn't add up.

09:47.044 --> 09:49.589
But then… take a look at this.

09:50.172 --> 09:52.258
Wow, that looks like
you're standing in front of her house.

09:52.341 --> 09:53.926
This is crazy, isn't it? Right?

09:54.010 --> 09:55.261
Wait. You see this?

09:56.053 --> 09:57.263
And there's more. Wow.

09:57.346 --> 09:59.515
This shot looks like
it was taken by paparazzi.

09:59.599 --> 10:00.933
It's so interesting, don't you think?

10:01.017 --> 10:02.602
Come on. Stop.

10:03.519 --> 10:04.604
There's more…

10:05.438 --> 10:06.897
Check my phone, hmm?

10:06.981 --> 10:08.649
Since I became your manager,

10:08.733 --> 10:10.651
this is my first time
to put my phone on silent mode.

10:10.735 --> 10:13.821
Ung, you have to give me something
if you expect me to answer all of them.

10:13.904 --> 10:15.573
You wouldn't answer
any of my calls earlier.

10:15.656 --> 10:16.949
So what do you want me to do?

10:17.033 --> 10:18.576
Where did I leave my phone?

10:19.118 --> 10:19.952
First of all…

10:22.204 --> 10:23.748
- tell me everything.
- What do I tell you?

10:23.831 --> 10:26.000
- Tell me it's not true.
- It's not.

10:27.126 --> 10:28.044
Really?

10:28.711 --> 10:30.379
All right, then. Good.

10:30.463 --> 10:31.714
It's fine if it's not the truth.

10:31.797 --> 10:34.925
I mean, it's all fake news. Right, Ung?
When I was reading it,

10:35.009 --> 10:37.219
it didn't make any sense.
What they said was impossible.

10:37.303 --> 10:39.639
Can you imagine?
People actually believe this shit.

10:39.722 --> 10:41.974
Goodness. It's ridiculous. There's no way.

10:42.058 --> 10:44.060
So, can you tell them that…

10:44.977 --> 10:48.856
we're not dating and that I… um,

10:48.939 --> 10:50.191
I'm just a fan of NJ.

10:53.235 --> 10:56.280
This must be such
a huge hassle for NJ, right?

10:56.364 --> 10:57.740
She helped us so much,

10:57.823 --> 10:59.992
but all we did in return
was ruin her reputation.

11:02.578 --> 11:04.413
Hey, where did I leave my phone?

11:05.122 --> 11:07.625
Why are you asking me?
I just got here. I haven't seen it.

11:07.708 --> 11:09.877
I'm sure you shoved it
somewhere in your studio.

11:17.968 --> 11:19.095
There it is.

11:22.932 --> 11:24.141
MISSED CALL, GU EUN-HO

11:25.768 --> 11:26.811
GU EUN-HO, FATHER, NJ

11:39.573 --> 11:42.910
Hello, Mr. Artist. I'm guessing
you lost your phone and just found it.

11:42.993 --> 11:45.413
- Am I right?
- Oh. Well, how did you know that?

11:45.496 --> 11:47.289
I think I know you a bit better now.

11:49.542 --> 11:52.670
I just saw the article about us.
I'm so sorry.

11:53.170 --> 11:55.464
I never thought
people would make it into a big issue.

11:55.548 --> 11:57.842
I think I caused
a lot of trouble for you, NJ.

11:58.634 --> 12:01.053
You got it wrong. You're the one
who might be in real trouble.

12:03.180 --> 12:05.850
I think my agency
might not refute the article.

12:05.933 --> 12:07.184
I guess they did the math

12:07.268 --> 12:09.937
and realized that I have something
to gain from all this.

12:10.020 --> 12:12.398
Sadly, they're trying
to take advantage of your good image.

12:12.481 --> 12:14.525
So you better tell everyone
that it's not true.

12:14.608 --> 12:16.485
Tell them I'm the one chasing you around.

12:16.569 --> 12:18.988
It's time for you
to teach my agency a lesson.

12:20.197 --> 12:23.367
Hang on. I'm not sure
I understand what you're saying,

12:23.451 --> 12:25.536
but wouldn't it be bad for you
if I do that?

12:26.537 --> 12:30.249
On a day like this I feel like I should
meet up with you so we could celebrate.

12:30.332 --> 12:32.543
After all, it's your first dating scandal.

12:34.253 --> 12:37.339
But unfortunately,
my schedule is too packed right now.

12:37.923 --> 12:39.759
I'll just call you again next time.

12:39.842 --> 12:40.843
Bye.

12:48.142 --> 12:50.269
That's right. He's a huge fan of NJ.

12:51.395 --> 12:54.857
What? A stalker fan?
Hey, what are you trying to say?

12:55.941 --> 12:57.777
Why on earth
would he follow her to her house?

12:57.860 --> 12:59.987
No, I mean, that's not what happened here.

13:01.071 --> 13:03.449
How dare you
talk about him like that, you idiot!

13:04.742 --> 13:05.785
What do you think you're doing?

13:06.285 --> 13:08.078
Just ignore them.
Don't talk to them anymore.

13:08.621 --> 13:09.789
Why not?

13:10.539 --> 13:12.583
I think we should wait
until they release a statement.

13:12.666 --> 13:13.626
Let's not get involved.

13:15.377 --> 13:16.754
Why are you changing your mind?

13:19.006 --> 13:20.174
Hey, wait.

13:20.257 --> 13:24.345
You didn't make some kind of agreement
with NJ about the article, or did you?

13:24.970 --> 13:26.597
Wow. You're unbelievable, Ung.

13:26.680 --> 13:29.725
Tell me, how close are you to NJ
that you could just…

13:31.435 --> 13:33.646
I swear, I never thought
it would come to this.

13:33.729 --> 13:35.272
You need to be honest with me.

13:36.816 --> 13:38.567
What's going on between you two?

13:38.651 --> 13:41.821
Shut up. What does my schedule
look like this week?

13:42.947 --> 13:45.449
You're acting so strange.
You're not the Ung I know.

13:45.533 --> 13:47.535
You're not Choi Ung, are you?
Give him back, now.

13:47.618 --> 13:49.912
Will you quit it with all that nonsense?

13:51.080 --> 13:52.414
This week you're busy.

13:52.498 --> 13:54.542
You have rescheduled interviews, remember?

13:54.625 --> 13:56.293
Plus, you also have documentary shoots.

13:56.377 --> 13:58.879
By the way, Friday is gonna be
the last day of filming.

13:58.963 --> 14:01.090
Yeon-su will be joining us
on that day too.

14:03.425 --> 14:05.427
So it's finally coming to an end, I guess.

15:08.073 --> 15:10.326
It's a good thing
Ung got to deliver it to you.

15:10.409 --> 15:11.619
Don't forget to heat it up.

15:11.702 --> 15:14.038
Hmm? That's very good.

15:14.121 --> 15:15.956
Tell me if there's anything else you want.

15:16.790 --> 15:18.834
I made all your favorite dishes,

15:18.918 --> 15:21.128
and I'll make some more
if that's not enough.

15:21.211 --> 15:23.672
Oh, is that so?

15:24.256 --> 15:26.383
All right, Ji-ung,
you should get back to work.

15:26.467 --> 15:29.094
Okay. I will see you soon. Bye.

15:30.012 --> 15:31.805
My goodness, what a brat.

15:31.889 --> 15:34.892
I really don't know why he has a phone
when he doesn't bother picking up.

15:34.975 --> 15:37.353
Oh, my. Why do you keep calling Ung?

15:37.436 --> 15:39.939
Just leave him alone. He must be sleeping.

15:40.022 --> 15:42.358
He's not. He says he can't sleep well.

15:42.441 --> 15:45.110
Maybe his meds are finally working.
If so, that's a good thing.

15:45.194 --> 15:49.156
Darn it. Even so, that foolish boy
better give us a call soon

15:49.239 --> 15:51.116
because my curiosity is killing me.

15:52.201 --> 15:54.244
By the way, do you really think

15:54.328 --> 15:58.248
there's something going on between
our son and that celebrity who came here?

15:58.332 --> 16:00.751
Leave him alone.
I'm sure he'll take care of it.

16:00.834 --> 16:02.753
He said they're only friends,
so they must be.

16:02.836 --> 16:04.296
- And besides…
- Mm?

16:06.507 --> 16:09.134
Our son already has Yeon-su,
you know that.

16:09.218 --> 16:10.928
- Yeon-su?
- Mm-hmm.

16:11.553 --> 16:14.682
Are you saying that, something
is going on between those two again?

16:14.765 --> 16:16.725
I thought they decided
they were going to be friends.

16:16.809 --> 16:18.268
I don't know.

16:18.352 --> 16:20.104
I think they'll eventually
end up together.

16:20.938 --> 16:22.356
Yeon-su…

16:23.273 --> 16:27.152
Hmm. I agree. When it comes to Ung,
Yeon-su is the perfect girl.

16:27.236 --> 16:29.071
- Right.
- Yes, of course.

16:29.154 --> 16:31.615
Of course, it's true.

16:32.241 --> 16:34.952
My goodness. Fall is already here.

16:35.035 --> 16:36.245
Oh, that's right.

16:36.328 --> 16:39.164
NOW SERVING GIZZARDS,
GRILLED OR SEASONED

16:43.752 --> 16:44.878
Is it this week?

16:51.260 --> 16:55.055
We should tell Ung that
we're going to visit the countryside.

16:55.139 --> 16:56.098
Hmm.

17:12.614 --> 17:13.782
INCOMING CALL
SOL-I

17:16.577 --> 17:18.495
- Hey.
- Where are you?

17:18.579 --> 17:21.206
I just finished a meeting.
I'm heading back to the office right now.

17:21.290 --> 17:24.752
- Why?
- Oh, nothing. Well, you know…

17:24.835 --> 17:27.171
I'm hanging up if this is nothing.
I'm driving.

17:28.464 --> 17:29.715
So are they really dating?

17:29.798 --> 17:31.258
- Choi Ung and NJ.
- I'm hanging up.

17:31.842 --> 17:33.719
Hey! Watch your temper.

17:33.802 --> 17:36.597
- You didn't ask him about it, did you?
- Why should I even ask him?

17:37.848 --> 17:40.726
I know you're hurting yourself by
imagining all sorts of things right now.

17:40.809 --> 17:42.686
Who? Me? Nope, not at all.

17:42.770 --> 17:43.979
I'm too busy working right now

17:44.063 --> 17:46.148
to think about useless things
that don't concern me.

17:46.732 --> 17:48.734
- You said you're driving.
- Goodbye.

18:17.429 --> 18:19.098
She's not Ung's type.

18:20.849 --> 18:22.017
She's pretty, but…

18:23.143 --> 18:25.312
Mm-hmm, she's pretty, but…

18:26.105 --> 18:27.815
Her smile's a bit…

18:30.526 --> 18:32.903
And she's way too young for him.

18:42.913 --> 18:45.457
Oh, Ji-ung,
what happened to you yesterday?

18:45.541 --> 18:49.002
Oh, sorry. Something came up.
Did you wait for me?

18:49.086 --> 18:50.754
It's okay, I had work to do anyway.

18:50.838 --> 18:52.923
But Mr. Choi was here,
and he waited for you.

18:55.467 --> 18:56.468
Ung was here yesterday?

18:56.552 --> 18:59.096
Yes, I told him you were coming back soon,

18:59.179 --> 19:01.640
so he waited in the editing room
for quite some time.

19:01.723 --> 19:03.058
I think he came here
to bring you some food.

19:08.188 --> 19:11.024
It was your birthday, right?
Happy birthday.

19:11.108 --> 19:13.694
Mr. Park wanted to throw you a party,
but I stopped him.

19:13.777 --> 19:16.488
Good job, thanks. You're so sharp
when it comes to those things.

19:17.364 --> 19:19.741
- You got a to shoot?
- Mr. Choi is going to do an interview

19:19.825 --> 19:21.410
so I'm heading out to shoot that.

19:21.493 --> 19:22.452
Ji-ung.

19:23.912 --> 19:27.457
In case I come back early after the shoot
and you have free time after work,

19:27.541 --> 19:28.959
please let me take you out to dinner.

19:29.042 --> 19:31.003
Seeing as it was
your birthday yesterday, I--

19:31.086 --> 19:33.172
It's fine. Birthdays aren't a big deal.

19:33.255 --> 19:35.465
- I'm just gonna--
- But I really wanna treat you.

19:38.343 --> 19:40.888
Or at least we could have some coffee.

19:46.059 --> 19:50.105
Sure, no problem. I'll make sure
you won't wanna buy me anything next year.

19:50.189 --> 19:51.940
- Good luck later.
- Okay.

19:59.990 --> 20:01.074
What is it?

20:01.617 --> 20:03.035
How long have you been standing there?

20:04.828 --> 20:07.539
Don't you remember?
You told me to wait for you over there.

20:08.832 --> 20:11.919
Oh, right. Did you get everything?

20:12.002 --> 20:13.086
Let's go.

20:13.170 --> 20:14.755
It's this way.

20:14.838 --> 20:16.006
Yeah, I knew that.

20:49.081 --> 20:50.207
Mr. Choi.

20:51.750 --> 20:53.001
Mr. Choi?

20:54.419 --> 20:55.379
Oh, yeah.

20:55.462 --> 20:58.590
Are you alright?
Was my question too difficult to answer?

20:58.674 --> 21:00.342
Oh, no. It's not that.

21:00.968 --> 21:03.595
I'm sorry, but could you repeat
your question one more time?

21:04.263 --> 21:07.015
You've said you don't like to include
people in your drawings.

21:07.099 --> 21:09.184
When I look at
the work you've done, it feels like

21:09.268 --> 21:11.311
you've purposely left people out of them.

21:11.395 --> 21:13.981
It seems to me like
you've intentionally left empty spots

21:14.064 --> 21:15.274
where they're supposed to be.

21:15.357 --> 21:18.902
That's probably why we can feel loneliness
and emptiness in your drawings.

21:18.986 --> 21:21.989
I think that comes
from your decision to exclude people.

21:22.072 --> 21:23.240
Was that act intentional,

21:23.323 --> 21:26.952
or does it have something to do
with your underlying emotions?

21:32.165 --> 21:36.712
I think it depends on the viewer.
Everyone can interpret them differently.

21:36.795 --> 21:39.464
Honestly, I really haven't given it
that much thought.

21:39.548 --> 21:42.634
I understand. But sometimes,
understanding the artist's attitude

21:42.718 --> 21:44.553
helps us to understand
their pieces better.

21:45.721 --> 21:46.847
I guess…

21:47.514 --> 21:49.725
I don't have the backstory that you want.

21:50.517 --> 21:51.852
Excuse me, ma'am.

21:52.477 --> 21:55.689
Why don't you ask about
the future exhibits he's planning to have?

21:55.772 --> 21:57.065
He's got a lot of those.

22:01.028 --> 22:05.198
It always feels as if it's impossible
to have an in-depth interview with you.

22:08.493 --> 22:09.661
Ma'am, it's not like that…

22:15.125 --> 22:16.126
Go pack up.

22:19.504 --> 22:22.424
I must say, you did look
quite different doing that interview.

22:25.344 --> 22:27.971
Show this side of me more.
Please show this in the documentary.

22:29.264 --> 22:31.266
This reminds me, I saw the article.

22:31.350 --> 22:33.977
Do you think the footage we filmed of NJ
is going to be an issue

22:34.061 --> 22:35.645
because of the story that's going around?

22:35.729 --> 22:37.856
Well, I don't have any problems with it,

22:37.939 --> 22:40.150
but you'll have to check with NJ's agency.

22:42.652 --> 22:46.073
Wait a minute. How come you're not asking
if the scandal is true or not?

22:46.156 --> 22:47.991
Do you think
the whole relationship's fake?

22:49.409 --> 22:50.285
Wow.

22:51.036 --> 22:54.498
It's incredible. Is Ji-ung sending out
clones of him or what?

22:54.581 --> 22:56.708
You're just like him.
This is making me feel weird.

22:57.292 --> 22:58.585
I'm sure you're acting like this,

22:58.668 --> 23:01.338
because you don't have room
to think about other people right now.

23:01.421 --> 23:03.340
You obviously have your hands full
with Yeon-su.

23:03.924 --> 23:07.094
Hey. Who said you could talk about
a private life so casually like that?

23:07.177 --> 23:09.554
Be thankful I turned off the camera first.

23:09.638 --> 23:11.932
If I had been Ji-ung,
I would have kept the camera rolling.

23:12.015 --> 23:13.975
Is it really turned off?
I should check it myself.

23:14.059 --> 23:16.353
You saw it, right? In the editing room?

23:18.772 --> 23:22.067
I'm taking about
the footage edited by Ji-ung.

23:25.070 --> 23:27.781
Well, I didn't know how to play it.

23:29.074 --> 23:31.493
We're done for today, right?

23:38.208 --> 23:39.209
I'm lonely.

23:40.043 --> 23:41.211
So very lonely.

23:42.337 --> 23:45.966
It's true, the position of CEO
can make one feel incredibly lonely.

23:47.008 --> 23:48.510
But as a true leader,

23:48.593 --> 23:52.639
I guess I should accept my fate
and take complete responsibility

23:52.722 --> 23:54.766
in order to fully develop this company.

23:55.517 --> 23:57.269
You noticed it just now, right?

23:57.936 --> 24:00.147
Everyone was having coffee without me

24:00.730 --> 24:03.733
and excluding me in their conversations.

24:05.026 --> 24:06.027
Don't you agree?

24:07.571 --> 24:09.364
Ms. Kook, are you listening to me?

24:10.365 --> 24:11.616
Hello?

24:12.242 --> 24:15.287
Honestly, in the first place,
I haven't done anything wrong, have I?

24:15.370 --> 24:18.123
Can you explain it to me?
Am I really such a bad person?

24:18.206 --> 24:19.249
You can be honest.

24:19.332 --> 24:21.501
You don't have to
filter anything, seriously.

24:23.378 --> 24:24.838
- Sir.
- Hmm?

24:24.921 --> 24:27.883
You know something, you're just
a little more clueless than others.

24:27.966 --> 24:29.843
You're not a bad person.
You were like that in college too.

24:30.427 --> 24:31.887
Just don't take it too personally.

24:34.973 --> 24:36.641
Who? Me?

24:38.143 --> 24:40.604
Excuse me, I'm pretty smart.

24:40.687 --> 24:44.232
In fact, I know perfectly well what
the others were talking about a while ago.

24:44.316 --> 24:47.360
And I could've smoothly joined in
on the conversation if I really wanted to.

24:47.444 --> 24:50.947
They were busy gossiping
about Go-oh and NJ the whole day.

24:51.448 --> 24:54.034
What do you think are
the chances of your ex getting involved

24:54.117 --> 24:56.036
in a scandal with a celebrity?

24:56.119 --> 24:58.079
Thing is,
they all want to know if it's true

24:58.163 --> 24:59.789
that those two are really dating or not.

24:59.873 --> 25:01.666
But they don't know anything.

25:02.417 --> 25:03.543
You wanna know what I think?

25:04.503 --> 25:05.795
Of course they're dating.

25:05.879 --> 25:08.965
Whatever the chances are,
one thing's for sure,

25:09.049 --> 25:12.010
- it feels very, very…
- When Go-oh saw NJ that day I could see

25:12.093 --> 25:13.220
he seemed totally mesmerized.

25:13.803 --> 25:15.764
- It feels very crappy.
- You see that?

25:15.847 --> 25:17.349
Told you I'm sharp. See, huh?

25:18.683 --> 25:20.519
All right, you are smart.

25:20.602 --> 25:22.979
So why don't you take a hint
and leave me alone?

25:23.063 --> 25:24.648
As you can see, I'm working right now.

25:25.232 --> 25:27.067
Hmm. I'm leaving.

25:27.817 --> 25:28.818
Take it easy.

25:31.404 --> 25:32.572
Told you I'm not clueless.

25:33.198 --> 25:36.993
I have to hear about it,
like it's everywhere I go all day long.

25:37.953 --> 25:39.496
Throughout the entire day…

25:44.459 --> 25:46.294
it follows me everywhere.

25:49.839 --> 25:51.925
NJ must really
be dating him this time.

25:52.008 --> 25:53.885
I know, right?
Did you see the photo?

25:53.969 --> 25:55.762
- He's kinda cute.
- What?

25:55.845 --> 25:57.681
He's super cute in his old photos too.

25:58.265 --> 26:00.475
Now I know the reason
why NJ fell for him.

26:00.559 --> 26:03.603
I really don't want
to hear or know more about them. 

26:09.943 --> 26:11.611
Right.

26:11.695 --> 26:13.947
Just keep walking. Keep walking.

26:23.582 --> 26:25.917
Excuse me, how much are these jujubes for?

26:26.001 --> 26:27.961
Oh, 5,000 won per basket.

26:28.044 --> 26:29.170
Oh. I'll get one, please.

26:29.254 --> 26:30.463
Yes, all right.

26:32.007 --> 26:34.259
Goodness. Don't you have any change?

26:34.342 --> 26:37.137
Oh. It's okay, I'll get all of them, then.

26:37.220 --> 26:40.181
Oh really? Thank you very much, dear.

26:40.265 --> 26:42.601
Are you sure? This is quite a lot.

26:43.268 --> 26:45.854
But what would a young lady
be doing with so many jujubes?

26:45.937 --> 26:48.565
Jujube tea is good is you have insomnia.

26:48.648 --> 26:49.482
What?

26:50.317 --> 26:51.818
I heard it somewhere.

26:52.569 --> 26:55.113
Is that so? Here you go.

26:55.780 --> 26:58.533
Oh, wait.
Let me put it in another bag for you.

26:58.617 --> 27:00.076
- Yeah, thanks.
- Here you go.

27:02.078 --> 27:03.705
- Have a good day.
- Bye.

27:15.675 --> 27:17.594
Why did I bother buying these?

27:22.349 --> 27:24.392
Ji-ung, we can go to a fancier place.

27:24.476 --> 27:26.561
I was going to buy you
something delicious.

27:27.395 --> 27:29.939
I have a hardy appetite.
You'll be surprised.

27:32.025 --> 27:33.193
Ji-ung!

27:33.276 --> 27:35.111
Hold on, Chae-ran's here too!

27:35.195 --> 27:39.449
Wow, you're eating here?
Oh, my, what a huge coincidence!

27:39.532 --> 27:41.409
Hmm, isn't this great?

27:41.493 --> 27:44.037
We've gathered in the same place, right?

27:46.956 --> 27:49.084
Come sit with us. Sit down.

27:59.135 --> 28:02.222
Why did I even bother going here?

28:19.948 --> 28:22.867
- Oh!
- Yes, I'll e-mail you… Oh, Yeon-su.

28:23.410 --> 28:25.870
I'm sorry. Let me check first
and I'll call you right away.

28:26.955 --> 28:27.956
Did you come here to see Ung?

28:28.039 --> 28:31.459
Yes, there's something I have to tell him.
He's just inside, right?

28:31.543 --> 28:32.669
He's not home now.

28:32.752 --> 28:35.046
I think he's still at the restaurant.
Should I call him?

28:35.130 --> 28:37.090
No, don't, it's fine. It's nothing urgent.

28:37.173 --> 28:39.217
- I can talk to him later.
- You came all the way here.

28:39.300 --> 28:40.719
- Go wait inside. Come on.
- No, it's okay.

28:40.802 --> 28:42.262
- You brought a lot of stuff too.
- It's really…

28:42.345 --> 28:43.972
It's okay, come inside.
He'll be back soon.

28:44.973 --> 28:45.974
Just go in.

28:46.641 --> 28:48.518
When you see Ung,
tell him I left already, okay.

29:30.018 --> 29:31.728
Listen, guys, I can't believe
we're only doing this now.

29:31.811 --> 29:33.646
We should have had a gathering sooner.

29:33.730 --> 29:36.441
Plus it was Mr. Kim's birthday yesterday.

29:36.524 --> 29:39.736
Don't you think
it's nice to drink together like this?

29:39.819 --> 29:41.529
Your work's all going well, right?

29:41.613 --> 29:44.073
Hey, PD Kim,
was it your birthday?

29:44.699 --> 29:47.160
I had no idea. Let me pour you a glass.

29:47.243 --> 29:49.496
It's fine, I already drank enough.

29:49.579 --> 29:51.164
Anyway, I'm not a heavy drinker like you.

29:51.247 --> 29:52.540
Oh, my goodness.

29:53.208 --> 29:55.919
How could you have lasted this long
in the field and not drink?

29:56.002 --> 29:58.087
It's not like we can drink
while we're working.

29:58.171 --> 29:59.798
Oh.

29:59.881 --> 30:02.467
I don't know why, but I really
can't appreciate people who don't drink.

30:02.550 --> 30:04.260
I find them so boring.

30:04.344 --> 30:05.970
At least I do my job well.

30:06.054 --> 30:07.806
Even your videos were boring.

30:11.976 --> 30:15.897
His work was better back in the day
when he listened to my advice.

30:15.980 --> 30:18.441
But now he just goes
and does anything he wants.

30:18.525 --> 30:19.818
Anything he wants, huh!

30:19.901 --> 30:22.737
You're only saying those things
because I never did what you wanted.

30:22.821 --> 30:24.948
You sure about that? Tell me something,

30:25.615 --> 30:27.408
do you really like what you've shot?

30:28.326 --> 30:30.036
You don't, right?

30:30.119 --> 30:33.832
No way. Have you lost your touch,
or what? Really?

30:35.124 --> 30:36.751
No way.

30:36.835 --> 30:38.711
We were all in a good drinking mood.

30:39.295 --> 30:40.880
Why are you
making him uncomfortable?

30:42.131 --> 30:44.342
Come on, Intern. Let's go.

30:44.425 --> 30:46.010
Oh, that's right, you quit.

30:46.094 --> 30:48.054
Finish your talk
before the food gets here.

30:48.805 --> 30:50.974
And will you two stop fighting for once?

30:51.057 --> 30:52.308
We're not fighting at all.

30:52.392 --> 30:54.477
This is how I show PD Kim
how much I like him.

30:54.561 --> 30:56.062
Unfortunately, he hates you.

30:56.145 --> 30:58.606
Couldn't you be nicer?
Why are you always so harsh?

31:00.316 --> 31:02.026
Man, I don't get her.

31:02.777 --> 31:06.072
Oh, did he have to overreact like that?
He's making me feel embarrassed.

31:10.410 --> 31:11.786
Did I upset you?

31:13.580 --> 31:14.581
Sorry.

31:15.623 --> 31:17.792
It's just that sometimes
when I'm telling the truth,

31:17.876 --> 31:20.461
I can't control
what's coming out of my mouth.

31:20.545 --> 31:23.214
What a way to emphasize
that you were telling the truth.

31:26.384 --> 31:28.261
Come on,
you know it's the truth.

31:31.139 --> 31:32.181
Why? What is it?

31:32.891 --> 31:34.392
What's your problem anyway?

31:34.976 --> 31:38.563
I saw your draft, but I still don't get
what you wanna say, hm?

31:43.026 --> 31:44.444
You like Yeon-su, don't you?

31:52.952 --> 31:54.412
What? No way.

31:55.371 --> 31:58.541
Am I right about that?
Was it because of that?

31:58.625 --> 32:01.711
Oh, this is finally getting interesting.

32:02.420 --> 32:04.797
Did you really have to blurt that out
in front of our co-worker?

32:05.715 --> 32:08.176
- You knew too, right?
- Forget it.

32:09.385 --> 32:12.055
Why are you guys all so quick to catch on?
It's embarrassing.

32:13.848 --> 32:15.516
That's the thing
about cameras.

32:16.184 --> 32:17.769
They pretend to be objective,

32:17.852 --> 32:20.647
but actually have
the most personal perspective.

32:20.730 --> 32:22.565
Ji-ung, the reason why I like you

32:22.649 --> 32:25.234
it's because you also pretend
to be an objective observer.

32:25.318 --> 32:28.321
But your pieces
portray your emotions very well.

32:28.905 --> 32:30.740
- You just called them boring.
- So I'm saying…

32:31.741 --> 32:35.578
you should go, watch your videos,
then edit them again.

32:36.829 --> 32:38.915
I get that you're trying
to show multiple perspectives

32:38.998 --> 32:41.084
because you are emotionally confused,

32:41.751 --> 32:43.169
but set that aside.

32:43.795 --> 32:46.506
Why don't you look at the cast
and follow their gaze?

32:51.010 --> 32:52.095
Okay?

33:13.282 --> 33:14.534
COTAULD GALLERY

33:16.202 --> 33:17.870
ARTIST GO-OH

33:20.331 --> 33:21.874
MUSEUM OF AVANT-GARDE
PARIS, FRANCE

33:24.502 --> 33:26.671
CONCERNING VARIABILITY AND INVARIABILITY

33:40.101 --> 33:40.977
Oh.

33:45.857 --> 33:48.067
Hi, good evening. Nice seeing you again.

33:48.901 --> 33:50.486
Oh. Right.

33:57.827 --> 33:59.078
The hell?

34:00.121 --> 34:01.289
Huh?

34:46.959 --> 34:47.960
HAPPY DAYS

34:50.129 --> 34:52.423
Congratulations on your scandal
with a superstar.

34:52.507 --> 34:54.342
Don't drink the whole bottle by yourself.

34:54.926 --> 34:55.968
Half of it's mine.

34:56.052 --> 34:58.554
P.S. Try not to stay out too late.

35:52.483 --> 35:54.735
There's something
I've been meaning to ask you.

35:57.864 --> 36:01.367
Listen, I'm not getting
between the two of you, am I?

36:01.450 --> 36:03.953
- Because I wouldn't want that.
- Not at all.

36:05.413 --> 36:08.499
I mean, there's nothing
going on between us right now.

36:08.583 --> 36:11.419
Oh. You said, "Right now".

36:15.214 --> 36:16.465
Are the two of you…

36:20.928 --> 36:22.138
Never mind.

36:23.097 --> 36:26.225
I'm guessing you read the article
that came out about us.

36:26.309 --> 36:28.019
But yes, Ung and I are dating.

36:33.691 --> 36:36.319
At least, that's what
I was thinking of saying,

36:36.402 --> 36:38.863
but hearing it out loud,
it sounds too corny.

36:39.614 --> 36:42.617
There's no point
talking about this by ourselves.

36:42.700 --> 36:44.827
Mr. Choi would be so proud
if he sees us like this.

36:44.911 --> 36:46.370
He'll brag about it forever.

36:47.205 --> 36:50.374
I have no plans of seeing him do that,

36:50.458 --> 36:52.043
so let's not fight about this.

36:53.711 --> 36:56.214
If I'm not in the way,
then this should be fine.

36:56.297 --> 36:57.798
I'll pursue this on my own.

37:11.687 --> 37:12.772
But then…

37:14.232 --> 37:16.359
something tells me you won't

37:16.442 --> 37:18.319
stop even if I tell you to.

37:25.493 --> 37:26.744
No, I won't.

37:48.933 --> 37:50.434
What am I even doing?

38:21.716 --> 38:22.758
Hey.

38:24.135 --> 38:25.386
Have you been drinking again?

38:30.016 --> 38:32.977
Wow, I guess
drinking agrees with you nowadays.

38:33.060 --> 38:34.353
This isn't like you.

38:39.150 --> 38:42.278
You should've gone home if you're drunk.
Why did you bother coming here?

38:44.864 --> 38:46.782
Thanks for bringing me food last time.

38:46.866 --> 38:49.160
What? You shouldn't thank me,
you should be thanking my mom.

38:49.243 --> 38:52.038
She told me to give it to you.
You came here just to say that?

38:52.913 --> 38:54.332
I heard you came by the office.

38:55.124 --> 38:56.709
Yeah, well…

38:56.792 --> 38:58.711
How come you always tell others
you're busy working

38:58.794 --> 39:00.212
when you weren't even at your desk?

39:05.718 --> 39:07.136
Just try to get some sleep.

39:08.012 --> 39:09.555
I'm going to work a bit more.

39:10.848 --> 39:12.141
Somebody told me…

39:14.518 --> 39:17.104
that the shots taken with my camera
are full of emotions.

39:20.441 --> 39:22.360
And that even if I try to hide it,

39:22.443 --> 39:24.612
it's no use, because it's so obvious.

39:27.198 --> 39:28.407
Do you think so too?

39:31.118 --> 39:32.953
No, I don't get what you're saying.

39:39.668 --> 39:41.295
You saw everything, right?

39:45.424 --> 39:46.342
Didn't you?

39:54.016 --> 39:55.309
Well…

39:59.563 --> 40:00.856
I'm really not sure.

40:00.940 --> 40:02.441
Wait.

40:03.859 --> 40:06.112
You mean you don't want me to mention it.

40:06.195 --> 40:07.196
Am I right?

40:08.906 --> 40:10.825
You're just drunk. Sleep it off.

40:14.370 --> 40:15.830
You're telling me to keep quiet

40:16.872 --> 40:18.374
because you don't want to know.

40:19.417 --> 40:20.292
Right?

40:34.014 --> 40:35.683
I knew this would happen,

40:38.519 --> 40:40.438
that makes me so upset.

41:02.460 --> 41:05.045
It's not like
our last day of filming is special.

41:15.264 --> 41:17.349
Wait, isn't today the day…

41:18.434 --> 41:21.812
SEAFOOD SOUP WITH UNG

41:21.896 --> 41:23.898
Did you just wake up
or you haven't slept yet?

41:23.981 --> 41:27.443
Anyway, I wanted to remind you
that today's the last day of filming.

41:27.526 --> 41:29.820
So get ready.
I'll head over soon. You got it?

41:29.904 --> 41:30.905
Okay.

41:35.576 --> 41:37.369
CLOSED TODAY

41:41.916 --> 41:43.834
Why isn't he answering his phone?

41:48.380 --> 41:51.258
Ji-ung, why is Mr. Choi acting like this?

41:51.342 --> 41:53.719
Does he think he can get away with it
because you two are friends?

41:53.802 --> 41:56.514
He's gone AWOL on the last day of filming.

41:56.597 --> 41:59.892
Why did he even agree to do this
if he was going to treat this as a joke?

41:59.975 --> 42:02.102
I'm sorry. Sorry. I apologize.

42:02.186 --> 42:04.230
I even called him this morning
to remind him of the shoot.

42:04.313 --> 42:06.815
You know what?
This isn't the first time he's done this.

42:06.899 --> 42:08.192
You should've made sure he was here.

42:08.275 --> 42:10.736
He's not taking us seriously.
In fact, why is he so disrespectful?

42:11.737 --> 42:13.405
Sorry. I'm really sorry.

42:13.489 --> 42:15.658
I'll go check out
all the places he could've gone to

42:15.741 --> 42:17.159
- and bring him back right away.
- Forget it.

42:18.035 --> 42:22.748
Ji-ung. You're always covering for him.
That's why he's being so selfish.

42:24.875 --> 42:27.086
Let me apologize instead. I'm sorry.

42:27.169 --> 42:29.213
- Let's just call it a day and--
- Excuse me, Ms. Kook.

42:29.296 --> 42:30.464
Don't you know what's going on?

42:30.548 --> 42:32.466
Did something happen
and you don't wanna tell us?

42:32.550 --> 42:34.343
- Stop, Chae-ran!
- I'm sorry about

42:34.426 --> 42:36.679
how we disappeared the last time.

42:36.762 --> 42:40.057
But I'm telling you nothing happened
between us. I haven't seen him in a while.

42:45.813 --> 42:47.690
Wait, isn't today the day…

42:52.278 --> 42:53.904
I'll try to bring him back.

42:53.988 --> 42:56.031
- Do you know what's going on with him?
- I don't.

42:56.115 --> 42:57.449
But I'm going to go look for him.

42:59.785 --> 43:00.911
Me too. I'll look for him too.

43:05.249 --> 43:08.335
Ji-ung, don't you think
you're being too easy on Mr. Choi?

43:09.128 --> 43:11.297
Even if he's your friend,
this is going too far.

43:12.840 --> 43:13.674
The thing is…

43:15.801 --> 43:17.845
I kind of feel like
maybe I chased him away.

43:18.429 --> 43:19.305
What?

43:36.905 --> 43:39.158
Oh. Hey, Ung! How are you?

43:39.241 --> 43:40.784
Hi. Nice to see you.

43:40.868 --> 43:42.453
It's been such a long time.

43:42.536 --> 43:44.913
I haven't seen you since you graduated.

43:44.997 --> 43:48.542
I'm glad you're here to visit me.
You should come by more often.

43:49.793 --> 43:51.420
Well…

43:51.503 --> 43:53.047
How come I don't see Jjongjjong?

43:53.130 --> 43:54.673
Oh, Jjongjjong?

43:54.757 --> 43:56.342
Uh, he's gone far away.

43:58.927 --> 44:02.681
Oh, my, is that so?
I'm so sorry, I was just…

44:02.765 --> 44:05.267
What? Oh, there he is.

44:06.143 --> 44:09.938
Looks like somebody had a blast
during their walk today, hmm?

44:10.022 --> 44:12.191
Oh, you definitely
need a bath today, Jjongjjong.

44:13.817 --> 44:14.985
- Thank you, girls.
- No problem.

44:15.069 --> 44:17.655
And I can take care
of all of Jjongjjong's walks.

44:18.280 --> 44:20.157
He's the cutest dog ever.

44:20.240 --> 44:21.492
- Goodbye and thank you.
- Oh, bye.

44:23.786 --> 44:27.414
Wait a minute. Didn't Jjongjjong hate
going outside because he was traumatized?

44:27.498 --> 44:29.750
Oh, that was such a long time ago.

44:30.250 --> 44:32.419
As a matter of fact,
he hates staying indoors now.

44:33.712 --> 44:36.215
I see. When did he change?

44:36.298 --> 44:37.966
And how did you do it?

44:38.050 --> 44:40.427
Oh, no, not me. I didn't do anything.

44:41.845 --> 44:43.472
He did it all by himself.

44:44.264 --> 44:45.599
Didn't you, Jjongjjong?

44:52.606 --> 44:53.691
You traitor.

45:06.912 --> 45:08.038
So cold.

45:11.959 --> 45:12.835
EDITING ROOM

45:20.300 --> 45:22.720
I get you're trying
to show multiple perspectives

45:22.803 --> 45:25.055
because you are emotionally confused,

45:25.139 --> 45:26.557
but set that aside.

45:27.182 --> 45:29.518
Why don't you look at the cast
and follow their gaze?

45:53.959 --> 45:56.754
Hey. I haven't found him. What about you?

45:56.837 --> 45:58.797
No. And I couldn't reach
his parents either,

45:58.881 --> 46:01.800
so I had to ask the hardware store owner.
He said they went to the countryside.

46:02.509 --> 46:04.678
He's not at the bookstore or the library.

46:04.762 --> 46:06.054
I can't find him anywhere.

46:06.138 --> 46:07.556
Like he really doesn't wanna be found.

46:07.639 --> 46:09.683
He's not going to be
at his usual spots then.

46:09.767 --> 46:11.185
Let's try unexpected places.

46:11.894 --> 46:13.729
Call me as soon as you find Ung.

46:19.860 --> 46:21.487
Oh! What the heck!

46:22.070 --> 46:25.699
You jerk! You… you scumbag!
You're such an idiot!

46:27.618 --> 46:29.036
I almost had a heartattack.

46:33.707 --> 46:35.250
Please, let me carry that for you.

46:35.334 --> 46:37.711
No need, it's fine. Don't sweat it.

46:37.795 --> 46:39.630
Oh, but your bag looks really heavy.

46:39.713 --> 46:42.049
I really don't mind carrying it for you
until you're home.

46:42.132 --> 46:43.383
I told you, it's okay.

46:43.467 --> 46:45.677
- Then at least until the bus station…
- I said, it's fine!

46:45.761 --> 46:48.013
I don't need your help.
Why are you doing this? No.

46:51.225 --> 46:52.184
Oh, no…

47:13.956 --> 47:15.290
You can leave it there.

47:18.627 --> 47:21.839
Right. It looks like
you're drying a lot of jujubes.

47:25.843 --> 47:27.094
Don't know what they're for.

47:27.177 --> 47:28.262
For some reason,

47:28.345 --> 47:30.889
Yeon-su bought a whole lot of them
recently and put them there.

47:31.473 --> 47:33.308
The foolish girl keeps making jujube tea.

47:33.392 --> 47:35.602
And she never tells me
who she's making it for.

47:40.524 --> 47:42.776
This is jujube tea.
You have a hard time sleeping…

47:43.652 --> 47:46.572
I mean, you're working,
so my boss told me to give this to you.

47:55.289 --> 47:57.499
I can't believe I'm gonna say this.

48:00.961 --> 48:05.716
If ever Yeon-su
has treated you badly or hurt you,

48:05.799 --> 48:07.885
I want you to know it's all my fault.

48:08.677 --> 48:10.596
That's why don't hate her too much.

48:11.430 --> 48:13.015
My family is poor,

48:13.974 --> 48:16.977
so while growing up,
I taught her to be selfish.

48:19.605 --> 48:22.691
I'm to blame.
It's my fault why she acts like that.

48:23.567 --> 48:25.235
Why she's so harsh.

48:25.319 --> 48:28.697
And it's also my fault
that she has a bad temper.

48:28.780 --> 48:29.948
That's why,

48:31.325 --> 48:33.952
if you're upset at her about something,

48:34.036 --> 48:36.204
you should blame me and no one else.

48:38.415 --> 48:40.167
Don't hate her for being that way.

48:46.256 --> 48:48.008
I know Yeon-su's not like that.

48:51.511 --> 48:53.639
She's neither selfish, nor mean.

48:54.556 --> 48:55.641
She's a…

48:57.684 --> 48:58.685
good person.

49:01.688 --> 49:03.982
She's so brilliant
it's like I don't deserve her.

49:05.943 --> 49:08.946
So, if you've known that all along,

49:09.821 --> 49:11.615
then what are you two doing?

49:14.159 --> 49:15.243
You're right, ma'am.

49:17.204 --> 49:18.747
I knew I was being pathetic,

49:21.166 --> 49:23.752
but I guess this is the day
I've finally hit rock bottom.

49:41.228 --> 49:42.437
Choi Ung.

49:45.065 --> 49:47.651
Stop hiding and come out already.

49:58.829 --> 50:00.998
Ji-ung,
do you want me to order dinner?

50:04.418 --> 50:05.377
Ji-ung…

50:18.098 --> 50:23.103
EDITING ROOM

50:29.067 --> 50:32.946
Uh, well, I think it's better
to do something you're good at

50:33.030 --> 50:35.866
rather than ending up
doing only something that you like.

50:35.949 --> 50:37.325
That way, you'll be more efficient,

50:37.409 --> 50:39.202
and you still gain from it
in the long run.

51:30.462 --> 51:32.714
It was much harder
to find you this time, Choi Ung.

51:40.597 --> 51:41.807
How did you find me?

51:41.890 --> 51:44.726
What do you think I did?
I just looked everywhere for you.

51:52.359 --> 51:54.694
I remember you doing this before.

51:54.778 --> 51:57.239
You used to disappear
around this time of year.

51:57.322 --> 51:59.991
And strangely enough,
your parents would disappear too.

52:01.743 --> 52:04.329
I had forgotten about it,
it came back to me today.

52:06.414 --> 52:09.501
The good thing is,
I've been wanting to do this for a while.

52:11.586 --> 52:15.048
To sit down with you
and have some drinks again.

52:52.878 --> 52:54.462
Are you done avoiding me?

52:57.174 --> 52:58.717
You're not even telling me to leave.

53:01.803 --> 53:03.013
I never avoided you.

53:04.639 --> 53:06.808
So you're saying I was imagining things?

53:33.210 --> 53:34.961
You're not saying a word.

53:42.719 --> 53:43.762
What should I say?

53:47.933 --> 53:51.102
You can say anything,
just don't… beat around the bush,

53:51.728 --> 53:53.188
or avoid the topic

53:54.564 --> 53:55.982
or deliberately hurt me.

54:06.493 --> 54:08.411
I guess you're choosing
to be silent again.

54:11.498 --> 54:13.083
Fine, but I'm going to talk.

54:33.561 --> 54:34.896
Ung, you know…

54:38.608 --> 54:39.776
It's about…

54:42.320 --> 54:45.824
About you asking
that we try and be friends.

54:50.704 --> 54:52.706
I've been thinking about it a lot and…

54:56.042 --> 54:57.168
I don't think I can do it.

55:01.256 --> 55:02.215
I mean…

55:03.508 --> 55:05.593
I'm not saying I don't wanna be friends.

55:08.555 --> 55:09.806
It's just…

55:12.017 --> 55:14.019
I just… I can't…

55:16.730 --> 55:17.981
I really missed you.

55:19.024 --> 55:20.108
Kook Yeon-su.

55:26.698 --> 55:28.992
I always… missed you.

55:35.957 --> 55:37.083
And I…

55:38.710 --> 55:39.753
I missed you.

55:47.844 --> 55:49.512
When you came back into my life,

55:52.932 --> 55:55.894
I kept feeling angry for some reason
even though you were finally back.

55:58.938 --> 56:01.107
I resented you so much.

56:04.819 --> 56:06.613
But I think I know the reason now.

56:10.325 --> 56:11.284
I guess…

56:12.994 --> 56:14.996
It was because
I wanted to see you love me.

56:21.127 --> 56:22.295
I want…

56:27.509 --> 56:29.552
I wanted to see you love only me.

56:45.902 --> 56:46.861
Yeon-su.

56:51.282 --> 56:52.283
Hmm?

56:54.702 --> 56:55.954
Yeon-su, keep loving me.

57:00.667 --> 57:01.709
Don't let me go…

57:03.962 --> 57:04.963
and keep…

57:06.840 --> 57:07.924
keep loving me.

57:16.558 --> 57:17.642
I beg you.

57:43.668 --> 57:50.425
OUR NIGHTS ARE MORE BEAUTIFUL
THAN YOUR DAYS

58:08.902 --> 58:11.863
EPILOGUE

58:14.365 --> 58:15.992
- Yeon-su.
- Hmm?

58:18.036 --> 58:20.497
Do you wanna know how a person
can see the top of a building?

58:21.372 --> 58:23.333
Yeah, you can go up
to a different building.

58:24.000 --> 58:25.376
Ding! Wrong answer.

58:29.005 --> 58:32.008
Hey, don't tell me that you're drunk?

58:35.220 --> 58:36.763
I was told this is how to do it.

58:37.347 --> 58:39.599
Who's the fool
who came up with a story like that?

58:40.266 --> 58:41.142
It was my dad.

58:42.185 --> 58:44.521
My goodness. He is a wise man.

58:49.484 --> 58:51.194
My gosh.

58:57.158 --> 58:58.451
I still can't see it, though.

58:58.535 --> 59:01.120
I know. That's exactly what I said.

59:02.080 --> 59:03.414
How long ago was that?

59:06.084 --> 59:08.962
When I was about five? Maybe six?

59:11.256 --> 59:13.591
I see, he was just teasing you then.

59:17.845 --> 59:19.013
Hm.

59:20.473 --> 59:21.975
It wasn't my current dad.

59:25.478 --> 59:26.312
What?

59:27.021 --> 59:28.106
It was my real dad.

59:32.235 --> 59:33.570
Sure he was teasing me.

59:34.320 --> 59:36.990
He told a little kid
to lie down on the ground

59:37.657 --> 59:39.742
and count
to the top floor of the building.

59:42.078 --> 59:43.788
I didn't even know how to count well then.

59:45.206 --> 59:46.791
I counted one, two…

59:47.959 --> 59:49.836
then I'd start with one all over again.

59:51.379 --> 59:52.755
Eventually, I got up.

59:56.843 --> 59:57.885
When I did,

59:59.846 --> 01:00:02.223
I saw my dad… was gone.

01:00:11.774 --> 01:00:12.692
Ung.

01:00:14.527 --> 01:00:15.570
Funny, right?

01:00:17.447 --> 01:00:18.656
How could he…

01:00:21.492 --> 01:00:23.244
just abandon me like that?
